WEBVTT

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:03.440
<i>My sword...</i>

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:12.780
What?

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:19.410
This is your fate for underestimating 
them as simple Noise...

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:24.920
Do not think you will escape with a mere defeat.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.440
What's going on?

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:29.460
Their Gears are dissolving!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.350
They aren't Noise?

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:35.820
Alca-Noise...

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:40.690
What will you do, Symphogear?!

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:36.630
<b>Episode 3 
Twilight of the Wielders</b>

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:45.100
Tsubasa!

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:56.840
Chris-san!

00:02:57.860 --> 00:02:59.650
Chris-san! Chris-san!

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.080
Ichaival's signal has been lost.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:09.320
To Noise? This can't be happening.

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:10.660
But the Symphogears are...

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:16.380
Their disintegration wasn't caused by the 
carbonization effect of the Noise?

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:20.370
The Alca-Noise were intended to dissect the world.

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:21.630
If used as a weapon...

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:25.240
Breaking through the various defensive fields

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:27.770
surrounding a Symphogear is simple for them.

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.580
System destruction confirmed.

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:37.250
That's one job done.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:58.300
Now for the next finale, with its next cast.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.460
I won't let you!

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:23.410
<i>Zeios Igalima raizen tron.</i>

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:55.270
Death! Death! Death!

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:58.270
<i>Danger signals flashing.</i>

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:01.530
<i>Hell or Heaven, which do ya want? Death!</i>

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.270
<b>K1LL JUL1ET</b>

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:05.650
<i>Attention! If you want to get chopped in half...</i>

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.620
<i>Watch out! Death!</i>

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:10.490
<i>A past you're a bit ashamed of,</i>

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:13.360
<i>burned aware in a blushing flare! Death!</i>

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.540
<b>Siren Tinkerbell</b>

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:16.540
<i>How high do I have to stack 'em</i>

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.660
<i>before I can see the future?</i>

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:20.040
You sure are flashy...

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:25.420
<i>These rails just go forward, right? Death!</i>

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:22.120
Kirika-chan's entered the mission area?

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:23.710
Without using LiNKER?

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:25.420
But if this works...

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:29.020
<i>Let's kiss and dream of a world</i>

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:31.430
<i>that we'll never cut apart!</i>

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:38.170
<i>If you just keep looking for what 
it takes to be stronger,</i>

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:43.740
<i>you'll never fulfill your true desires.</i>

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.810
<b>Type Alpha 100 Samsara</b>

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:45.240
Goddess Zababa...

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:47.410
<i>Holding the courage to be strong in your heart,</i>

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:47.950
All that flash was a diversion?

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:50.460
<i>as a light envelops the Moon.</i>

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:53.160
<i>I want to shine down on you</i>

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:53.160
A diversion on top of a diversion?

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.800
<i>with one half of a pair of true loves.</i>

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:58.730
<i>Just loving!</i>

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:06.000
<i>I knew it... Our compatibility coefficients</i>

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:08.090
<i>aren't high enough to use the Gears properly!</i>

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:09.840
Shirabe!

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.280
I'm fine... We have more important 
things to worry about.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.020
I know.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:22.980
They were not part of the plan. 
Your orders, please.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.280
No need to pursue.

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:28.030
You are ordered to return home.

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:31.530
That goes for you, as well, Phara.

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:34.900
Understood. As you wish.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:47.140
What did she mean, we wouldn't 
escape with a mere defeat?

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.340
Shirabe-chan and Kirika-chan 
are exiting the area.

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:54.100
Chris-chan and the other girl are safe, also.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:57.080
Hurry and meet up with the wielders, 
and get them back here.

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:05.960
<i>She has the same face as 
the Alchemist Carol...</i>

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:16.950
Even without LiNKER, we wouldn't 
lose to someone like that!

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:19.460
Kiri-chan...

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.580
I know!

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:26.600
How far should we go?

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:30.010
As far as we can.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.510
But then nothing will be different than it was.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:41.400
We were orphans, taken to a world

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:43.520
where the walls and ceilings were all white.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.940
We thought the Symphogears
 we met there were a special power

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.820
that blew away all the horrible things

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.570
that had happened before then.

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:06.260
To protect humanity from the 
disasters caused by the relics,

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:08.960
we needed to use the relics' power.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:11.170
That was what Mom thought,

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.340
and we wanted to help her, but...

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:17.470
We used our power to do as we were told,

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:21.090
but all we learned was that 
we couldn't change anything.

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:24.610
All we had was what Mom and 
Maria wanted to do.

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:29.120
We couldn't find what we wanted to do,

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:30.990
and that's why it happened!

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:35.170
If you go as far as you can without a goal, 
there's no guarantee

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.560
you'll find that goal at the end.

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:40.120
Struggling blindly isn't good enough.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.080
Is that why

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:45.460
they wouldn't let us come with them, maybe?

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:49.210
Good...

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.050
Are you okay?

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:53.670
Of course I'm not!

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.750
<i>The girls I was supposed to protect 
protected me instead.</i>

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:03.220
<i>Of course I'm not okay!</i>

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:08.230
Total defeat.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:12.150
No, it might be worse than that.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:17.320
We can safely assume that, when the 
Gear vanished, the clothes I had on

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:22.580
didn't come back because the 
converter was damaged.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:25.300
Then your Symphogear was...

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:30.700
The Absolute Blade, Ame no Habakiri, 
has been broken.

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:35.920
Chris-chan's Ichaival and Tsubasa-san's 
Ame no Habakiri were badly damaged.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:39.800
Without Ryouko-san, what are we supposed to do?

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.510
Where's Hibiki-kun?

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:44.310
I'm fine.

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.050
I'm sorry.

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:49.900
If only I'd been able to talk to Carol-chan...

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:53.120
Talk to her?

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.930
We've heard the report.

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:05.160
However, Maria Cadenzavna Eve,

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:08.670
the restrictions on your person 
have not been lifted.

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:14.360
Commander Kazanari,

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.550
I'm requesting a transfer to S.O.N.G.

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:18.550
Maria...

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:20.800
I don't have a Gear.

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:22.470
But in this situation,

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.500
I cannot remain an idol.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:39.210
<i>Today, in cooking class, 
we're making beef stroganoff.</i>

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:45.540
<i>You know it from anime and manga,
 it's beef stroganoff.</i>

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.540
<i>Cut the onion in two, from the top.</i>

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:51.540
<i>Cut the tomato in half, from the side.</i>

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:54.640
<i>Mix some flour with the meat,</i>

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:55.150
Whoosh!

00:10:54.640 --> 00:10:57.550
<i>and it doesn't have to be beef!</i>

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.670
<i>Add the mushrooms to the onions.</i>

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:03.550
<i>Add the milk, and when it starts to boil...</i>

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:06.470
<i>Finish with a rendezvous of salt and pepper.</i>

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:09.990
<i>Add some sour cream, and it's done!</i>

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:15.440
<i>Boys don't know this.</i>

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:17.030
<i>It's surprisingly (surprisingly)</i>

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.570
<i>simple (simple).</i>

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:23.960
<i>Beef stroganoff!</i>

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:24.680
Meow!

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:30.440
<i>Today, in cooking class, 
we're making beef stroganoff.</i>

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:36.700
<i>You know it from anime and manga,
 it's beef stroganoff.</i>

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:43.340
Ah, it's called "beef stroganoff,"

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:46.850
so I never thought you could put 
things other than beef in it!

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:50.110
Russian cooking is so deep!

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:54.110
If you keep talking, you won't have time to eat.

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:56.170
Don't worry!

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:03.950
That's what you get for not paying 
attention when using a knife...

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:06.240
That's right.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.190
It isn't good to hurt yourself

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:11.040
with a kitchen utensil, is it?

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:17.280
<i>The Symphogears are supposed 
to protect and save people.</i>

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:21.800
<i>I don't want to hurt anyone with them...</i>

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:24.770
What happened in that last mission?

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:28.850
Shirabe-chan and Kirika-chan are in 
the hospital for observation, right?

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:32.340
I'm bored!

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:36.270
Hospital food has no flavor.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:44.470
But don't worry!

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:47.160
If we can just talk to her,
 I'm sure we can make her understand.

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:51.020
You're always this way.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.550
You're returning to Japan?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.500
It was my dream to sing all around the world.

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:05.210
But...

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:08.790
If that is your decision, I'd like to respect it.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:13.090
But would you promise me that, someday,

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:15.060
you'll pursue your dream again?

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:18.020
I...

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:24.490
<i>The plane will be landing soon.</i>

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:27.440
<i>Please fasten your seatbelts.</i>

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:34.500
Tsubasa-san!

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:36.500
Maria-san!

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:48.140
All of the Symphogear-wielders are here.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:51.230
Or maybe we can't say that now.

00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:53.750
What's this?

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:56.270
The Ichaival and Ame no Habakiri

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:58.900
that were destroyed by the new type of Noise.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:02.320
The relic fragments at their cores are safe, but...

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:08.030
The functionality that converts the 
energy into a protector was lost.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:12.080
Just like with Serena's Gear!

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:16.210
Of course you can fix it, right?

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.130
The disclosure of Sakurai Theory

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:22.800
has rapidly advanced heretical 
technology research worldwide.

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:27.970
But even so, we can't repair the 
Symphogear system without Ryouko-san.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:33.350
Right now, the only wielder 
we have is you, Hibiki-kun.

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:35.280
Just me?

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:37.320
That isn't true!

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:38.970
We are also...

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:39.950
No.

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:42.080
Why not?

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:47.750
Who knows how much strain the Symphogears 
are putting on your bodies,

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.280
without using LiNKER to boost compatibility?

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:55.330
Without the LiNKER that was 
specifically tuned for you,

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.290
we can't push you too hard.

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:00.280
Then we are still

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.960
merely useless children, aren't we?

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:05.710
I know the medical check results

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:07.700
are worse than we thought.

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:08.800
But even so...

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:12.990
I never want to lose a companion 
 over something like that again.

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:15.360
Your feelings are more enough.

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:21.410
Here I go!

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:45.050
It's taken longer than expected 
to gather enough memories

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:47.460
to use Micha, our strongest asset.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:49.310
Oh, jeez.

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:51.340
I worked really hard, you know?

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:56.470
It was very hard to do this 
without standing out!

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.410
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:04.520
This means all the Autoscorers are activated.

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:08.400
We can move the plan to the next stage.

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:14.990
What is it, Micha?

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:19.750
I'm too hungry to move.

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:21.330
Garie...

00:16:22.470 --> 00:16:23.960
Right, right.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:26.000
That's my job, right?

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:30.130
And I have one more job for you.

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:32.530
Come to think of it, meister,

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:35.640
it appears Elfnein was taken in by them.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.820
I'm aware.

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:42.900
I followed Carol's orders

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:46.110
and worked to construct part of a huge device.

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:49.360
One day, I accessed the database 
and learned that

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:53.520
this device was intended to dissect 
the world into tiny parts.

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:56.940
And I ran away to stop her.

00:16:57.240 --> 00:17:00.240
Dissect the world into tiny parts?
That's pretty scary.

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:04.750
And alchemy is what makes that possible.

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:09.810
As you can see by looking at the Alca-Noise,
which were based on the recipe for the Noise,

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:14.530
they already have the power to disintegrate 
any material, including Symphogears.

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:19.730
This huge device still under construction, 
the Château de Tiffauges,

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:21.930
is meant to increase this power 
to a worldwide scale.

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:25.200
If you were participating in its construction,

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:27.690
does that mean you are an alchemist, too?

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.040
Yes.

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:34.500
But unlike Carol, I do not command all 
the abilities and knowledge of one.

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:37.950
I was made only for a specific, limited purpose.

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:39.570
"Made"?

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:42.230
I was only installed with the

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:46.000
minimum alchemical knowledge 
required to construct the device.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.280
You said, "installed"?

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:52.590
By that, I mean transferring necessary information 
directly into the brain as knowledge.

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:56.590
Unfortunately, the knowledge installed in me

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:58.570
doesn't contain the plan's details.

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:00.100
But...

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:03.700
I can say that the world-dissection device,

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:06.180
the Château de Tiffauges, is almost complete!

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:10.330
Please! Help me!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:14.730
That's why I've brought Dvergr Dáinn's legacy here!

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:17.610
Dvergr Dáinn's legacy?

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:19.620
A relic that can stand

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:25.770
against the power of the Alca-Noise 
and of the Alchemist Carol.

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:29.880
A fragment of the magic sword Dáinsleif.

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:35.850
These are the results of our 
examination of Elfnein-chan.

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:41.760
Just in case, we did a medical 
check of her... Yes, of her.

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:45.090
There are no problems with her 
health or bodily functions.

00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:50.520
And we saw no signs of implants or 
post-hypnotic suggestion, but...

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:52.720
But?

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:56.780
She... Elfnein-chan does not have a sex.

00:18:57.030 --> 00:19:00.550
She says she is simply a homunculus,

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:02.530
and not suspicious at all.

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.460
Th-That's extremely suspicious.

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:06.500
Yes...

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:14.320
I don't think it really matters that much

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:16.650
what parts you have attached.

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:20.590
Why are you freaking out, Bikky?

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:25.010
Um, I mean... What parts are, um, well...

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:29.890
We were talking about what parts 
we might get for the school play.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.150
You were spacing out again, weren't you?

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:36.030
You're right!

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:38.650
Lately, you've been this way all the time.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:40.800
Sorry.

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:42.840
A lot's going on.

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:48.180
Then this is the Alca-Noise that destroyed 
the Ame no Habakiri in London?

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:49.160
Yes.

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.860
I think I've made an excellent reproduction.

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:54.720
That's taking avant-garde too far!

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:58.370
Do you plan to make your worldwide 
debut in the modern art world, too?

00:19:58.370 --> 00:19:59.680
The problem is the fact

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:04.180
that we only have one Symphogear-wielder 
who can fight the alchemist

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:06.580
that commands the Alca-Noise.

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.260
Can't we understand each other

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:11.770
without fighting?

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:14.040
Are you running away?

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:15.950
I don't think I'm running away!

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:18.030
But...

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:22.620
Ever since I realized that the Gungnir 
is really my own power,

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:26.370
I've hated the idea of hurting 
someone with a power

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:28.710
that should be used to help them.

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:31.220
That is

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:34.380
simply the arrogance of the powerful!

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:39.840
<i>That isn't what I meant, though...</i>

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:56.360
The Grail's been filled with memories.

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:58.860
And the girl who is to be sacrificed appears.

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:02.070
You're one of Carol-chan's friends, right?

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:05.850
As well as the enemy you must fight.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:10.520
No! I want to help people!

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:12.250
I don't want to fight!

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:32.140
I know exactly how to make 
bratty little girls like you fight.

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:34.460
She's really nasty.

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:36.960
This isn't a good situation for us!

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:38.310
At this rate...

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:42.480
I'll trample that ideal little 
flower garden in your head.

00:21:53.590 --> 00:21:54.600
Hibiki?

00:21:57.890 --> 00:21:59.210
I can't sing...

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:00.340
Huh?

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:03.590
Just give it up already.

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:09.090
The holy words won't come to me...

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:17.640
Gungnir won't answer me!
